  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "development-layout-and-save",
      "verification": "software",
      "statement": "The current generic entrance preserves discovery/probe/feedback/warm behavior and never treats feedback/save as exact-root acceptance. It corrects V2-OUTPUT-COVERAGE by rejecting project root, project ancestor and all project-internal outputs before saving or batch/status execution rather than excluding source subtrees; all new actions share that rule and old entry layout behavior remains retained. Original F1 late source/destination checks remain present. Portable and actual nested-source save/batch regressions exercise the rejected layout without creating the destination. Observed freshness is not an OS-wide transaction."
    },
    {
      "id": "complete-tool-and-terminal-binding",
      "verification": "software",
      "statement": "The loaded/common tool identities include every existing lean_evidence.TOOL_NAMES entry, including lake_build_guard.py and run_manifest.schema.json. Nonempty independently authored roots still invoke the retained strict verifier and terminal evidence checks with common bindings, including original F2 source/list/evidence checks. Actual two-root verify and actual durable-job status reject a guard or schema edit immediately after both real terminal checks returned true. Status completes potentially large manifest/contract/stdout/job reads before final freshness snapshots and binds summary/job/stdout/stderr bytes; real and portable tests reject source/summary changes after stdout reads. No OS-wide filesystem transaction is claimed."
    },
    {
      "id": "complete-readable-type",
      "verification": "software",
      "statement": "Development probes and strict LeanVerifyProbe retain pp.all/universes/explicit and explicitly enable deepTerms/proofs with supported finite maxSteps10000000/maxRecDepth8192, rejecting compiler failures or remaining omission markers as incomplete. Strict derivation/evidence recheck rejects absent/omitted readable types. Native4.31 interface attempts and the original v2 omission are preserved. A current actual 512-leaf balanced conjunction prints all 512 equalities without omission in development and strict output and retains 512 actual/expected encoded Eq nodes; deliberately limited printing is incomplete. Full encoded expressions and transitive dependencies remain bound and no arbitrary-size completeness guarantee is claimed."
    },
    {
      "id": "unchanged-native-review-and-hidden-processes",
      "verification": "software",
      "statement": "The native review adapter remains byte-identical to its earlier tested/reviewed source, preserving actual collaboration.spawn_agent canonical identities with explicit fresh-none context, frozen prompt, author exclusion and matching FINAL_ANSWER completion; absent/ordinary messages cannot approve, and identity is coordinator-attested transcript consistency. Native Windows Lean/Lake/LSP/rg/workflow child hidden launch behavior remains unchanged; current portable/workflow and retained real reruns pass. manage87 is earlier unchanged-source execution, not a v4 rerun. No installation, Linux/WSL execution, universal UI no-flicker or timing claim is made."
    }
  ],
